{"table":"evidence","ref":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/evidence/R2-26-SR-044","record":{"id":"R2-26-SR-044","kind":"semantic_review","status":"not_run","command":[],"tool":"Source-located authored warrant; independent semantic review pending","source_ids":["scalar-r2-26-source-algorithm-application","support_tex_main","support_tex_variation"],"subject_ids":["scalar.separate_classical_algorithm","support.full_relative_support"],"details":"The algorithm proof applies thm:full-support to a minimizer to obtain the EAMS no-overlap-gap input. Attainment is supplied separately by the manuscript main.tex:94–107 and the existing scalar.minimizer_attainment support. The same attained gamma_0 is used for full support and strict increase. This authored application records the full-support input only, not a proof or formalization of the external algorithm theorem."},"usage":{"record_ref":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167dc286a45dd429a8dff192df88b5/evidence/R2-26-SR-044","paper_focus":[],"paper_memberships":[{"stage":"long","subgraph_ref":"sha256:135459bb2961c95bd09cfce135666cd5a51fd11bb2c943829fdd7b81efdfef5d/papers/long.json/support/0.3.1/2f85413164f06365ea0d825befee447650da71d54080d5dd65e78a708891c560","roles":["associated_record"]},{"stage":"short","subgraph_ref":"sha256:cfbe950801fd334d8fd957243fa3b1f716ef609148c5f2ff97d44f9a6443d82c/papers/short.json/support/0.3.1/77f0cf29ab577b42d8caa5b2831ebfb1ca170d4b13c1ef6897cadc8e93c2a834","roles":["associated_record"]},{"stage":"expository","subgraph_ref":"sha256:479155de953858e60f1454491ccda2215d88a4c2780e686cdfb8422481c62d9c/papers/expository.json/support/0.3.1/9dd5536bc567fc55efaa864733bf89747cea0268a8a3865dec51ddd8e2a235dd","roles":["associated_record"]}],"direct_passages":[]},"aligned_passages":[],"lenses":{},"relations":[{"family":"provenance","id":"field:73dca405fb56d482df6b2bf565a9f647f8879439022c9980d07bcb63d0cc3825","from":"sha256:9a43c3eddb32c8ae6201629ef2e4df2d94167d